|blurb2       = {{sbc|Blood Frenzy:}} '''Briar''' breaks free from her pillory, turning {{tip|berserk}} against the nearest enemy, prioritizing {{tip|champions}}, and gaining {{tip|ghosting}}, {{sti|{{as|'''bonus''' attack speed}}}} and {{sti|{{as|'''bonus''' movement speed}}}}. During this time, she also empowers her basic attacks to deal {{as|physical damage}} to enemies around her target.
|blurb3       = '''Briar''' can also cast {{ai|Chilling Scream|Briar}} to end the ''Blood Frenzy'' early.
}}

